{"title": "[Brand] Handheld Garment Steamer, 260ml Tank, 1200W, Auto Shut-Off", "bullets": ["READY IN ABOUT 25 SECONDS – Our 1200W handheld steamer heats up in about 25 seconds (based on our in-house testing), so you can de-wrinkle a shirt or dress before heading out instead of waiting around.", "STEAM HANGING OR FLAT – Use it vertically to refresh clothes right on the hanger, or horizontally on a flat surface for pants, linens, and more. One compact steamer handles both, no ironing board required.", "EASY-FILL DETACHABLE 260ML TANK – The water tank removes from the steamer, so refilling at the sink is quick and mess-free. The 260ml capacity gives you room to steam several garments between fills.", "AUTO SHUT-OFF FOR PEACE OF MIND – Built-in auto shut-off adds an extra layer of convenience if you get distracted mid-task. Designed for standard US outlets (120V, 60Hz).", "FABRIC BRUSH INCLUDED – Attach the included fabric brush to help work steam into thicker fabrics and smooth out garments as you go. A practical pick for home, dorm, or travel use."], "description": "Skip the ironing board. The [Brand] Handheld Garment Steamer puts 1200 watts of steaming power in a compact design that heats up in about 25 seconds (based on our in-house testing). Whether it's a wrinkled work shirt, a dress straight out of the suitcase, or curtains that need a refresh, you can get it done quickly.

Steam vertically while clothes hang, or switch to horizontal steaming for items laid flat. The 260ml water tank detaches for easy refilling at the sink, and the included fabric brush helps you handle heavier materials. An auto shut-off feature adds convenience during everyday use.

Built for US households with a 120V, 60Hz plug, this handheld steamer is easy to keep in a closet, dorm room, or carry-on, so you always have a quick way to look put-together.", "search_terms": "clothes steamer portable fabric wrinkle remover travel steamer handheld steam iron vertical horizontal dorm hanging shirt dress curtain compact 120v", "notes_zh": "标题按75字符上限写（66字符），资料无材质信息未编造；25秒注明为内部测试；未提UL/ETL及CE/CB等认证，避免误导；无检测资料未写Prop 65相关内容，需供应商确认是否需警示。"}
